WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.900
Three days later, the laptop is still missing.

2
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.800
The technician marks it as lost in Observer RMM.

3
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:10.600
That night, at a café, someone finds it and turns it on.

4
00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:16.500
It joins the café's network and reports back:
its location on the map and a photo of whoever has it.

5
00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:20.000
Its alarm goes off, and an on-screen message asks for help.

6
00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:25.700
Two phone calls later, the laptop is back with IT,
and one click marks it as recovered.

7
00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:29.600
Observer RMM: your devices, always under control.
